    "Close the official WHOOP app (or turn its phone's Bluetooth off), put the strap in pairing mode (on a 5.0/MG, tap the band repeatedly until the LEDs flash blue), then reconnect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close the official WHOOP app (or turn its phone's Bluetooth off), put the strap in pairing mode (on a 5.0/MG, tap the band repeatedly until the LEDs flash blue), then reconnect."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cierra la app oficial de WHOOP (o apaga el Bluetooth de ese teléfono), pon la banda en modo de emparejamiento (en una 5.0/MG, da toques firmes a la banda hasta que los LED parpadeen en azul) y vuelve a conectar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
