            "value": "El Coach dijo: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coach uses your own API key. Pick a provider, paste a key, and choose a model. Your key is stored securely in the macOS Keychain and never leaves your Mac except as the request you make.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coach uses your own API key. Pick a provider, paste a key, and choose a model. Your key is stored securely in the macOS Keychain and never leaves your Mac except as the request you make."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El Coach usa tu propia clave de API. Elige un proveedor, pega una clave y selecciona un modelo. Tu clave se guarda de forma segura en el llavero de macOS y nunca sale de tu Mac salvo en la solicitud que tú hagas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coefficient of variation = how spread out your daily stress is around its own average, as a percentage. Low = steady. A steadier signal usually means your load and recovery are in balance. (Plews 2013)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coefficient of variation = how spread out your daily stress is around its own average, as a percentage. Low = steady. A steadier signal usually means your load and recovery are in balance. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coeficiente de variación = qué tan disperso está tu estrés diario alrededor de su propio promedio, en porcentaje. Bajo = estable. Una señal más estable suele significar que tu carga y tu recuperación están en equilibrio. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coefficient of variation = how spread out your recovery is around its own average, as a percentage. Low = steady. A steadier recovery usually means your body is coping well with your load. (Plews 2013)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coefficient of variation = how spread out your recovery is around its own average, as a percentage. Low = steady. A steadier recovery usually means your body is coping well with your load. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coeficiente de variación = qué tan dispersa está tu recuperación alrededor de su propio promedio, en porcentaje. Bajo = estable. Una recuperación más estable suele significar que tu cuerpo lleva bien tu carga. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coefficient of variation = standard deviation ÷ the mean of your last few weeks. It measures how spread out your values are around your average. Low = steady. In HRV, a rising CV can precede fatigue even while the value still looks high. (Plews 2013)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coefficient of variation = standard deviation ÷ the mean of your last few weeks. It measures how spread out your values are around your average. Low = steady. In HRV, a rising CV can precede fatigue even while the value still looks high. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coeficiente de variación = desviación estándar ÷ promedio de tus últimas semanas. Mide qué tan dispersos están tus valores respecto a tu media. Bajo = estable. En HRV, que el CV suba puede preceder a la fatiga, aunque el valor siga alto. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
