    "Each point is one night. The recommended zone for an adult is 7–9 h.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each point is one night. The recommended zone for an adult is 7–9 h."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada punto es una noche. La zona recomendada para un adulto es de 7 a 9 h."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each point is your daily stress index. The bands behind it are the fixed Low / Moderate / High zones (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3). The percentage compares this month's average with last month's; Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected. What matters isn't a single day — it's several days in a row drifting into a higher band.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each point is your daily stress index. The bands behind it are the fixed Low / Moderate / High zones (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3). The percentage compares this month's average with last month's; Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected. What matters isn't a single day — it's several days in a row drifting into a higher band."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada punto es tu índice de estrés diario. Las bandas detrás son las zonas fijas Bajo / Moderado / Alto (0–1 / 1–2 / 2–3). El porcentaje compara el promedio de este mes con el del mes pasado; Promedio, Mínimo y Máximo salen del rango que seleccionaste. Lo que importa no es un día suelto — son varios días seguidos subiendo de banda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each second of heart rate is mapped to one of five intensity zones; time in the higher zones counts for much more. The weighted total is compressed onto a 0–21 scale through a logarithmic curve, so the top of the scale represents a theoretical full day at peak intensity.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each second of heart rate is mapped to one of five intensity zones; time in the higher zones counts for much more. The weighted total is compressed onto a 0–21 scale through a logarithmic curve, so the top of the scale represents a theoretical full day at peak intensity."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada segundo de frecuencia cardiaca se asigna a una de cinco zonas de intensidad; el tiempo en las zonas altas cuenta mucho más. El total ponderado se comprime a una escala de 0 a 21 con una curva logarítmica, así que el tope representa un día entero teórico a intensidad máxima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score). They're combined with the weights above and mapped onto a 0–100 scale through a logistic curve, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. It's an estimate, not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits (a z-score). They're combined with the weights above and mapped onto a 0–100 scale through a logistic curve, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58. It's an estimate, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada señal se vuelve una puntuación de qué tan por encima o por debajo de tu promedio personal está (un z-score). Se combinan con los pesos de arriba y se mapean a una escala de 0–100 con una curva logística, calibrada para que un día típico caiga cerca de 58. Es una estimación, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits; they're averaged with the weights above and mapped onto a 0–100 scale, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each signal becomes a score of how far above or below your personal average it sits; they're averaged with the weights above and mapped onto a 0–100 scale, calibrated so a typical day lands near 58."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada señal se vuelve un puntaje de qué tan arriba o abajo está de tu promedio personal; se promedian con los pesos de arriba y se ajustan a una escala 0–100, calibrada para que un día típico caiga cerca de 58."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each square is a day, tinted by your recovery — red when low, amber in the middle, green when high. Empty squares are days with no reading. It's the at-a-glance shape of your last three months. (Buchheit 2014)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each square is a day, tinted by your recovery — red when low, amber in the middle, green when high. Empty squares are days with no reading. It's the at-a-glance shape of your last three months. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada cuadro es un día, tintado por tu recuperación — rojo cuando es baja, ámbar en medio, verde cuando es alta. Los cuadros vacíos son días sin lectura. Es la forma de un vistazo de tus últimos tres meses. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each square is a day, tinted by your recovery; empty squares are days with no reading.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each square is a day, tinted by your recovery; empty squares are days with no reading."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada cuadro es un día, tintado por tu recuperación; los cuadros vacíos son días sin lectura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
