    "HRV": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV carries the most weight — it's the best window onto your autonomic nervous system. What matters is the average of your recent nights, not a single day. If a signal is missing on a given night, its weight is shared among the others. (Plews 2013; Buchheit 2014)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV carries the most weight — it's the best window onto your autonomic nervous system. What matters is the average of your recent nights, not a single day. If a signal is missing on a given night, its weight is shared among the others. (Plews 2013; Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La HRV es la que más pesa: es la mejor ventana a tu sistema nervioso autónomo. Lo que importa es el promedio de tus últimas noches, no un día suelto. Si falta una señal en una noche, su peso se reparte entre las demás. (Plews 2013; Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV has dropped well below your baseline, pointing to elevated stress or fatigue. Ease off and give your body time to recover.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV has dropped well below your baseline, pointing to elevated stress or fatigue. Ease off and give your body time to recover."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La HRV cayó muy por debajo de tu línea base, lo que apunta a estrés o fatiga elevados. Baja el ritmo y dale a tu cuerpo tiempo de recuperarse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is a little low": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV is a little low"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "la HRV está un poco baja"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is above baseline, a sign of a relaxed, well-recovered nervous system. Stress is low.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV is above baseline, a sign of a relaxed, well-recovered nervous system. Stress is low."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La HRV está por encima de tu línea base, señal de un sistema nervioso relajado y bien recuperado. El estrés es bajo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is how much the time between your heartbeats varies, in milliseconds, while you sleep. More variation usually means better recovery. What matters isn't the number itself, but how it compares with your own average.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV is how much the time between your heartbeats varies, in milliseconds, while you sleep. More variation usually means better recovery. What matters isn't the number itself, but how it compares with your own average."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La HRV es cuánto varían, en milisegundos, los tiempos entre tus latidos mientras duermes. Más variación suele indicar mejor recuperación. Lo que importa no es el número en sí, sino cómo se compara con tu propio promedio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HRV is personal. There are no universal good/bad thresholds — only your trend over time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HRV is personal. There are no universal good/bad thresholds — only your trend over time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La HRV es personal. No hay umbrales universales de bueno o malo —solo tu tendencia en el tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
