            "value": "Qué tan parecido es tu punto medio de sueño noche a noche — predice tu salud mejor que las horas totales."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How even it stays from one week to the next. Steadier usually means better rest; very uneven can be fatigue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How even it stays from one week to the next. Steadier usually means better rest; very uneven can be fatigue."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué tan pareja está de una semana a otra. Más pareja suele ser mejor descanso; muy dispareja puede ser fatiga."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long it took you to fall asleep after lights out. Ten to twenty minutes is a healthy range.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How long it took you to fall asleep after lights out. Ten to twenty minutes is a healthy range."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto tardaste en quedarte dormido tras apagar la luz. De diez a veinte minutos es un rango saludable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many breaths you take per minute while you sleep. It's one of the steadiest signals your body has, so even a small rise from your own normal can be an early sign of strain, illness, or a late, heavy meal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many breaths you take per minute while you sleep. It's one of the steadiest signals your body has, so even a small rise from your own normal can be an early sign of strain, illness, or a late, heavy meal."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuántas respiraciones tomas por minuto mientras duermes. Es una de las señales más estables de tu cuerpo, así que incluso una subida pequeña respecto a tu normal puede ser un aviso temprano de carga, de que algo viene, o de una cena pesada y tardía."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many times you briefly woke during the night. A few are completely normal — everyone surfaces between sleep cycles.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many times you briefly woke during the night. A few are completely normal — everyone surfaces between sleep cycles."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuántas veces te despertaste brevemente durante la noche. Unas pocas son del todo normales: todos salimos a flote entre ciclos de sueño."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the last month you spent with low autonomic load.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How much of the last month you spent with low autonomic load."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto del último mes pasaste con carga autonómica baja."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much you slept versus what your body needs. At 100% you fully covered last night's need.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How much you slept versus what your body needs. At 100% you fully covered last night's need."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuánto dormiste frente a lo que tu cuerpo necesita. Al 100% cubriste por completo lo que necesitabas anoche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
