    "It's a comparison of your fitness, not your biological age or a medical diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's a comparison of your fitness, not your biological age or a medical diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una comparación de tu condición física, no tu edad biológica ni un diagnóstico médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's an association, not a cause. Things like training on the days you already wake up well (then drifting back down), resting when you're tired or sick, or which day of the week you train all play a part.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's an association, not a cause. Things like training on the days you already wake up well (then drifting back down), resting when you're tired or sick, or which day of the week you train all play a part."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una asociación, no una causa. Influyen cosas como entrenar justo los días que amaneces bien (y luego «bajar» de forma natural), descansar cuando estás cansado o enfermo, o el día de la semana en que sueles entrenar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's an estimate from your own history, not a diagnosis.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's an estimate from your own history, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una estimación a partir de tu propio historial, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's an estimate, not a diagnosis.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's an estimate, not a diagnosis."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es una estimación, no un diagnóstico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's the average of your heart rate variability over the last week. Higher usually goes hand in hand with better recovery.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's the average of your heart rate variability over the last week. Higher usually goes hand in hand with better recovery."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es el promedio de tu variabilidad cardiaca de la última semana. Más alta suele ir de la mano con mejor recuperación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's your average breathing rate while you sleep. It's usually very steady; if it rises above your normal, it can be an early sign that something is taxing you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's your average breathing rate while you sleep. It's usually very steady; if it rises above your normal, it can be an early sign that something is taxing you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es tu ritmo de respiración promedio mientras duermes. Suele ser muy estable; si sube sobre tu normal, puede ser señal temprana de que algo te está exigiendo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's your lowest heart rate while you sleep. Lower usually points to better fitness and rest.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's your lowest heart rate while you sleep. Lower usually points to better fitness and rest."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es tu frecuencia cardiaca más baja mientras duermes. Más baja suele indicar mejor forma y descanso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
