    "Move all your Cénit data to another machine. Export saves everything — history, sleeps, workouts, settings — to a single file you can copy across; import replaces this Mac's data with a backup.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move all your Cénit data to another machine. Export saves everything — history, sleeps, workouts, settings — to a single file you can copy across; import replaces this Mac's data with a backup."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mueve todos tus datos de Cénit a otra máquina. Exportar guarda todo — historial, sueño, entrenamientos, ajustes — en un solo archivo que puedes copiar; importar reemplaza los datos de esta Mac con un respaldo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move all your NOOP data to another machine. Export saves everything — history, sleeps, workouts, settings — to a single file you can copy across; import replaces this Mac's data with a backup.": {
