            "value": "Edad física"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Physical age measures only the cardiorespiratory side. This one also weighs sleep, regularity, HRV and steps — so the two can differ.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Physical age measures only the cardiorespiratory side. This one also weighs sleep, regularity, HRV and steps — so the two can differ."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Edad física mide solo el lado cardiorrespiratorio. Esta también pesa sueño, regularidad, HRV y pasos — por eso pueden no coincidir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Physical repair. Your body restores itself and releases growth hormone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Physical repair. Your body restores itself and releases growth hormone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reparación física. El cuerpo se restaura y libera hormona de crecimiento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a folder in iCloud Drive and Cénit keeps a fresh copy of all your data there. Your strap history lives only inside the app, so this is what protects it if you reinstall Cénit or switch phones. It uses your own iCloud Drive — a free Apple ID is enough.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick a folder in iCloud Drive and Cénit keeps a fresh copy of all your data there. Your strap history lives only inside the app, so this is what protects it if you reinstall Cénit or switch phones. It uses your own iCloud Drive — a free Apple ID is enough."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elige una carpeta en iCloud Drive y Cénit guarda ahí una copia fresca de todos tus datos. El historial de tu banda vive solo dentro de la app, así que esto es lo que lo protege si reinstalas Cénit o cambias de teléfono. Usa tu propio iCloud Drive — basta con un Apple ID gratis."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a folder in iCloud Drive and NOOP keeps a fresh copy of all your data there. Your strap history lives only inside the app, so this is what protects it if you reinstall NOOP or switch phones. It uses your own iCloud Drive — a free Apple ID is enough.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
