    "Stress rises when your resting heart rate runs higher than usual OR your HRV drops below usual — both are classic signs your nervous system is activated. We measure each against your own 30-day baseline. RMSSD for HRV (Task Force, 1996).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stress rises when your resting heart rate runs higher than usual OR your HRV drops below usual — both are classic signs your nervous system is activated. We measure each against your own 30-day baseline. RMSSD for HRV (Task Force, 1996)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El estrés sube cuando tu frecuencia en reposo está más alta de lo usual O tu HRV cae por debajo de lo usual — ambas son señales clásicas de que tu sistema nervioso está activado. Medimos cada una contra tu propia base de 30 días. RMSSD para la HRV (Task Force, 1996)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
