        }
      }
    },
    "The line is your 7-day moving average over the period you pick. The percentage compares this month's average with last month's. Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The line is your 7-day moving average over the period you pick. The percentage compares this month's average with last month's. Average, Lowest and Highest come from the range you selected."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La línea es tu promedio móvil de 7 días en el periodo que elijas. El porcentaje compara el promedio de este mes con el del mes pasado. Promedio, Mínimo y Máximo salen del rango que seleccionaste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The line is your 7-day moving average over the period you pick. The percentage compares this month's average with last month's. The average and range come from the range you selected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The line is your 7-day moving average over the period you pick. The percentage compares this month's average with last month's. The average and range come from the range you selected."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La línea es tu promedio móvil de 7 días en el periodo que elijas. El porcentaje compara el promedio de este mes con el del mes pasado. El promedio y el rango salen del periodo que seleccionaste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The line shows how your strain piled up through the day — each second of heart rate adds to the running total, so it only ever rises. It ends on today's score above.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The line shows how your strain piled up through the day — each second of heart rate adds to the running total, so it only ever rises. It ends on today's score above."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La línea muestra cómo se fue acumulando tu esfuerzo durante el día — cada segundo de frecuencia cardiaca suma al total, así que solo sube. Termina en tu puntaje de hoy, arriba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The lower it is, the younger.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The lower it is, the younger."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuanto más baja, más joven."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The monitor beats in real time when your WHOOP is nearby and worn.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The monitor beats in real time when your WHOOP is nearby and worn."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El monitor late en tiempo real cuando tu WHOOP está cerca y puesta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same measure, 0–100:": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same measure, 0–100:"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La misma medida, 0–100:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The share of your recent days that sat in the Low band (under 1.0). Higher is better — it means your body had room to recover. It's a count of days, not a measure of how low any single day went.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The share of your recent days that sat in the Low band (under 1.0). Higher is better — it means your body had room to recover. It's a count of days, not a measure of how low any single day went."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La proporción de tus días recientes que cayeron en la banda Baja (menos de 1.0). Más alto es mejor — significa que tu cuerpo tuvo margen para recuperarse. Es un conteo de días, no una medida de qué tan bajo llegó un día en particular."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The share of your sleep spent in deep and REM — the stages that physically and mentally restore you. Around 40–50% is typical for a healthy adult.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The share of your sleep spent in deep and REM — the stages that physically and mentally restore you. Around 40–50% is typical for a healthy adult."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La parte de tu sueño en profundo y REM, las etapas que te restauran física y mentalmente. Cerca del 40–50% es lo típico en un adulto sano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The slope is how much it rises or falls on average per day, by linear regression over the period. The percentage vs last month compares this month's average against the previous one. Average, Lowest and Highest are from the range you selected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The slope is how much it rises or falls on average per day, by linear regression over the period. The percentage vs last month compares this month's average against the previous one. Average, Lowest and Highest are from the range you selected."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La pendiente es cuánto sube o baja en promedio por día, por regresión lineal sobre el periodo. El porcentaje vs el mes pasado compara el promedio de este mes contra el anterior. Promedio, Más bajo y Más alto son del periodo que elegiste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The thread of you over time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The thread of you over time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El hilo de ti a través del tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These bands are the same for everyone because the index is already adjusted to your own baseline, not to the population — a 1.5 sits at YOUR normal. So there's no personal ± range to compute: what's worth watching is drifting into «High» for several days in a row.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These bands are the same for everyone because the index is already adjusted to your own baseline, not to the population — a 1.5 sits at YOUR normal. So there's no personal ± range to compute: what's worth watching is drifting into «High» for several days in a row."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estas bandas son iguales para todos porque el índice ya viene ajustado a tu propia base, no a la población — un 1.5 cae en TU normal. Por eso no hay un rango personal ± que calcular: lo que vale la pena vigilar es pasar a «Alto» varios días seguidos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These power your heart-rate zones, calorie estimates and recovery baselines. Keep them accurate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These power your heart-rate zones, calorie estimates and recovery baselines. Keep them accurate."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos datos alimentan tus zonas de frecuencia cardiaca, las estimaciones de calorías y tus líneas base de recuperación. Mantenlos precisos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thinking"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pensando"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This builds from the strap as it syncs. Strain and sleep appear after you have worn it and slept a night. Recovery needs about a week of nights to learn your baseline, or import your WHOOP export to skip the wait.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This builds from the strap as it syncs. Strain and sleep appear after you have worn it and slept a night. Recovery needs about a week of nights to learn your baseline, or import your WHOOP export to skip the wait."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto se construye desde la banda conforme sincroniza. El esfuerzo y el sueño aparecen después de usarla y dormir una noche. La recuperación necesita alrededor de una semana de noches para aprender tu línea base, o importa tu exportación de WHOOP para saltarte la espera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is how your Charge tends to look the morning after each sport, compared with your rest days. It's what we observe in your history, not a cause-and-effect link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is how your Charge tends to look the morning after each sport, compared with your rest days. It's what we observe in your history, not a cause-and-effect link."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Así suele verse tu Charge la mañana después de cada deporte, comparado con tus días de descanso. Es lo que observamos en tu historial, no una relación de causa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the only feature that leaves your Mac — it sends a summary of your metrics to %@ using your own key. Nothing is sent until you ask.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the only feature that leaves your Mac — it sends a summary of your metrics to %@ using your own key. Nothing is sent until you ask."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta es la única función que sale de tu Mac — envía un resumen de tus métricas a %@ usando tu propia clave. No se envía nada hasta que tú preguntes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
