    "Wake up to this many minutes early if the Mac stays awake & connected and a light phase is detected.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wake up to this many minutes early if the Mac stays awake & connected and a light phase is detected."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Despierta hasta estos minutos antes si la Mac sigue despierta y conectada y se detecta una fase de sueño ligero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We can't calculate your physical age yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We can't calculate your physical age yet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todavía no podemos calcular tu edad física."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We can't score your recovery yet. We need at least %lld nights with your strap to learn your baseline; you're at %lld of %lld. We'd rather not show you a made-up number.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We can't score your recovery yet. We need at least %lld nights with your strap to learn your baseline; you're at %lld of %lld. We'd rather not show you a made-up number."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aún no calculamos tu recuperación. Necesitamos al menos %lld noches con tu strap para conocer tu línea base; llevas %lld de %lld. Preferimos no darte un número inventado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We compare the median of your Charge the morning after each sport against your “untouched” rest days (no workouts, and not the days right after a session). The difference is what you see here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We compare the median of your Charge the morning after each sport against your “untouched” rest days (no workouts, and not the days right after a session). The difference is what you see here."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comparamos la mediana de tu Charge la mañana siguiente a cada deporte contra tus días de descanso «intactos» (sin entrenamientos y fuera de los días posteriores a una sesión). La diferencia es lo que ves aquí."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV to your own 30-day baseline. A higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the score up — classic signs the body is activated. The combined shift is mapped onto a 0–3 scale: 0 is calm, 1.5 sits at your baseline, 3 is highly activated.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV to your own 30-day baseline. A higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the score up — classic signs the body is activated. The combined shift is mapped onto a 0–3 scale: 0 is calm, 1.5 sits at your baseline, 3 is highly activated."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comparamos la frecuencia cardiaca en reposo y la HRV de hoy con tu propia línea base de 30 días. Una FC en reposo más alta de lo normal y una HRV más baja de lo normal empujan la puntuación hacia arriba — señales clásicas de que el cuerpo está activado. El cambio combinado se mapea a una escala de 0 a 3: 0 es calma, 1.5 es tu línea base y 3 es muy activado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline. A higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the score up — classic signs the body is activated. The combined shift becomes a z-score sum, squashed onto 0–3 by a logistic curve: 0 calm, 1.5 at your baseline, 3 highly activated.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV with your own 30-day baseline. A higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the score up — classic signs the body is activated. The combined shift becomes a z-score sum, squashed onto 0–3 by a logistic curve: 0 calm, 1.5 at your baseline, 3 highly activated."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comparamos tu frecuencia en reposo y tu HRV de hoy con tu propia base de 30 días. Una frecuencia en reposo más alta de lo usual y una HRV más baja de lo usual empujan el número hacia arriba — señales clásicas de que el cuerpo está activado. El desplazamiento combinado se vuelve una suma de z-scores, comprimida a 0–3 por una curva logística: 0 en calma, 1.5 en tu base, 3 muy activado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We count your breaths across the night from the slow rise and fall in your heart-rate signal (respiratory sinus arrhythmia) and report the nightly mean.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We count your breaths across the night from the slow rise and fall in your heart-rate signal (respiratory sinus arrhythmia) and report the nightly mean."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contamos tus respiraciones a lo largo de la noche a partir del sube y baja lento de tu frecuencia cardiaca (arritmia sinusal respiratoria) y reportamos la media de la noche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We line up this vital against your own sleep and the prior day's strain, night by night across your history, and read which way it leans (Pearson correlation). We only show a direction once there are enough paired nights (about six weeks) and the link is strong enough to be unlikely to be chance — never the number, and never as a cause. (Plews 2013)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We line up this vital against your own sleep and the prior day's strain, night by night across your history, and read which way it leans (Pearson correlation). We only show a direction once there are enough paired nights (about six weeks) and the link is strong enough to be unlikely to be chance — never the number, and never as a cause. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alineamos este vital con tu propio sueño y con el esfuerzo del día anterior, noche por noche a lo largo de tu historial, y leemos hacia dónde se inclina (correlación de Pearson). Solo mostramos una dirección cuando hay suficientes noches pareadas (unas seis semanas) y la relación es lo bastante fuerte como para que sea poco probable que sea azar — nunca el número, y nunca como causa. (Plews 2013)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We line up your day strain against your own recovery and the prior day's strain, day by day across your history, and read which way it leans (Pearson correlation). We only show a direction once there are enough paired days (about six weeks) and the link is strong enough to be unlikely to be chance — never the number, and never as a cause. (Plews 2013; Vesterinen 2016)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We line up your day strain against your own recovery and the prior day's strain, day by day across your history, and read which way it leans (Pearson correlation). We only show a direction once there are enough paired days (about six weeks) and the link is strong enough to be unlikely to be chance — never the number, and never as a cause. (Plews 2013; Vesterinen 2016)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comparamos tu esfuerzo del día contra tu propia recuperación y el esfuerzo del día anterior, día con día a lo largo de tu historial, y leemos hacia dónde se inclina (correlación de Pearson). Solo mostramos una dirección cuando hay suficientes días emparejados (unas seis semanas) y la relación es lo bastante fuerte para que sea poco probable que sea azar — nunca el número, y nunca como causa. (Plews 2013; Vesterinen 2016)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We need a few more nights to show your 7-day average, your normal range and the trend.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We need a few more nights to show your 7-day average, your normal range and the trend."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesitamos unas noches más para mostrar tu media de 7 días, tu rango normal y la tendencia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We need a few more nights with your strap to learn your baseline before we score your recovery. We'd rather not show a made-up number.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We need a few more nights with your strap to learn your baseline before we score your recovery. We'd rather not show a made-up number."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesitamos unas noches más con tu banda para aprender tu base antes de calcular tu recuperación. Preferimos no mostrarte un número inventado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We need about 6 sessions of the same sport to start showing how you wake afterward. Keep logging your workouts and this fills in on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We need about 6 sessions of the same sport to start showing how you wake afterward. Keep logging your workouts and this fills in on its own."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Necesitamos unas 6 sesiones de un mismo deporte para empezar a ver cómo amaneces después. Sigue registrando tus entrenamientos y esto se llena solo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We take the intervals between your heartbeats overnight, drop any outside 300–2000 ms and any that deviate more than 20% from their neighbours (ectopic beats). If at least 20 clean beats remain, we compute RMSSD.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We take the intervals between your heartbeats overnight, drop any outside 300–2000 ms and any that deviate more than 20% from their neighbours (ectopic beats). If at least 20 clean beats remain, we compute RMSSD."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tomamos los intervalos entre tus latidos durante la noche, descartamos los que quedan fuera de 300–2000 ms y los que se desvían más de 20% de sus vecinos (latidos ectópicos). Si quedan al menos 20 latidos limpios, calculamos el RMSSD."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We take today's resting heart rate and HRV and express each as how far it sits from your 30-day average (a z-score). A resting HR above your norm and an HRV below it both add to the load; the two are summed and squashed onto a 0–3 scale where 0 is calm, 1.5 is your baseline, and 3 is highly activated.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We take today's resting heart rate and HRV and express each as how far it sits from your 30-day average (a z-score). A resting HR above your norm and an HRV below it both add to the load; the two are summed and squashed onto a 0–3 scale where 0 is calm, 1.5 is your baseline, and 3 is highly activated."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tomamos tu frecuencia cardíaca en reposo y tu HRV de hoy y expresamos cada una como qué tan lejos está de tu promedio de 30 días (un z-score). Una FC en reposo por arriba de tu norma y una HRV por debajo suman a la carga; las dos se combinan y se ajustan a una escala de 0 a 3, donde 0 es calma, 1.5 es tu línea base y 3 es muy activado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wear the strap for a few nights and your readiness read will appear here.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
