          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your heart rate across the day, averaged in 5-minute buckets.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu frecuencia cardíaca a lo largo del día, promediada en intervalos de 5 minutos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your heart rate falls into one of four intensity zones through the day. The highlighted row is where today's score lands on the 0–21 scale.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your heart rate falls into one of four intensity zones through the day. The highlighted row is where today's score lands on the 0–21 scale."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu frecuencia cardiaca cae en una de cuatro zonas de intensidad a lo largo del día. La fila resaltada es donde aterriza tu puntaje de hoy en la escala de 0 a 21."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your heart rate when your body is fully at rest — how hard your heart has to work doing nothing. Lower generally means a stronger, more efficient cardiovascular system. Cénit uses it as ~20% of your recovery score; a rise from your norm can signal fatigue or that something's coming on.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your heart rate when your body is fully at rest — how hard your heart has to work doing nothing. Lower generally means a stronger, more efficient cardiovascular system. Cénit uses it as ~20% of your recovery score; a rise from your norm can signal fatigue or that something's coming on."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu frecuencia cardíaca cuando tu cuerpo está en reposo total: lo que le cuesta latir sin hacer nada. Más baja suele indicar un sistema cardiovascular más fuerte y eficiente. Cénit la usa como cerca del 20% de tu recuperación; una subida respecto a tu norma puede señalar fatiga o que algo se está gestando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your live heart rate is working from the strap, and recovery, strain and sleep build from it over your next few nights of wear, sharpening as it learns your baseline. Want your full history instantly? Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources and it backfills in about a minute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your live heart rate is working from the strap, and recovery, strain and sleep build from it over your next few nights of wear, sharpening as it learns your baseline. Want your full history instantly? Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources and it backfills in about a minute."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu frecuencia cardiaca en vivo ya funciona desde la banda, y la recuperación, el esfuerzo y el sueño se construyen a partir de ella durante tus próximas noches de uso, afinándose mientras aprende tu línea base. ¿Quieres tu historial completo al instante? Importa tu exportación de WHOOP en Fuentes de datos y se rellena en un minuto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your need is your own rolling average of recent nights, never under 7.5 h.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your need is your own rolling average of recent nights, never under 7.5 h."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu necesidad es tu propio promedio de las últimas noches, nunca menos de 7.5 h."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your night moves through four phases. The watch estimates them from your movement and heart rate, so they're approximate — it gets about 2 of 3 right.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your night moves through four phases. The watch estimates them from your movement and heart rate, so they're approximate — it gets about 2 of 3 right."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu noche pasa por cuatro fases. El reloj las estima con tu movimiento y tu ritmo cardiaco, así que son aproximadas: acierta cerca de 2 de cada 3."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your normal range": {
