          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your personal baseline: a moving average of your recent nights (weighted toward the latest) ± a band of your own variation. A value outside the band is unusual for you, not for the population. It becomes reliable after about 14 nights. (Buchheit 2014)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your personal baseline: a moving average of your recent nights (weighted toward the latest) ± a band of your own variation. A value outside the band is unusual for you, not for the population. It becomes reliable after about 14 nights. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu línea base personal: una media móvil de tus noches recientes (con más peso en las últimas) ± una banda de tu propia variación. Un valor fuera de la banda es atípico para ti, no para la población. Se vuelve confiable tras unas 14 noches. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your personal baseline: the average of your recent recovery days ± a band of your own variation. A day outside the band is unusual for you, not for the population. (Buchheit 2014)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your personal baseline: the average of your recent recovery days ± a band of your own variation. A day outside the band is unusual for you, not for the population. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu base personal: el promedio de tus días de recuperación recientes ± una banda de tu propia variación. Un día fuera de la banda es inusual para ti, no para la población. (Buchheit 2014)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your recovery is high, but %@ is flagging — keep an eye on that today.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
