    "Day-to-day persistence (r = %@, n = %lld) — the same signal compared with itself, so there's no independent significance to report.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Day-to-day persistence (r = %@, n = %lld) — the same signal compared with itself, so there's no independent significance to report."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Persistencia de un día a otro (r = %@, n = %lld) — la misma señal comparada consigo misma, así que no hay una significancia independiente que reportar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regularity is the night-to-night variability of your mid-sleep point (the midpoint between falling asleep and waking) — a steadier schedule predicts health more strongly than how long you sleep. Naps don't count: only your main night (at least 3 h) feeds regularity. Stages are estimated from movement, heart rate and HRV, so they're approximate; deep sleep repairs the body, REM consolidates memory and emotion. \"Need\" is a 7–9 h population target, not a measurement of you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regularity is the night-to-night variability of your mid-sleep point (the midpoint between falling asleep and waking) — a steadier schedule predicts health more strongly than how long you sleep. Naps don't count: only your main night (at least 3 h) feeds regularity. Stages are estimated from movement, heart rate and HRV, so they're approximate; deep sleep repairs the body, REM consolidates memory and emotion. \"Need\" is a 7–9 h population target, not a measurement of you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La regularidad es la variabilidad noche a noche de tu punto medio de sueño (el punto medio entre dormirte y despertar) — un horario más parejo predice tu salud con más fuerza que cuánto duermes. Las siestas no cuentan: solo tu noche principal (de al menos 3 h) entra en la regularidad. Las etapas se estiman del movimiento, la frecuencia cardíaca y la HRV, así que son aproximadas; el sueño profundo repara el cuerpo, el REM consolida memoria y emociones. La «necesidad» es un objetivo poblacional de 7–9 h, no una medición tuya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We didn't count your %@ nap — regularity uses only your main night.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We didn't count your %@ nap — regularity uses only your main night."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No contamos tu siesta de %@ — la regularidad usa solo tu noche principal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We didn't count your naps (under %@) — regularity uses only your main night.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "We didn't count your naps (under %@) — regularity uses only your main night."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No contamos tus siestas (menos de %@) — la regularidad usa solo tu noche principal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coach uses your own API key. Pick a provider, paste a key, and choose a model. Your key is stored securely in the device Keychain and never leaves your phone except as the request you make.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coach uses your own API key. Pick a provider, paste a key, and choose a model. Your key is stored securely in the device Keychain and never leaves your phone except as the request you make."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coach usa tu propia clave de API. Elige un proveedor, pega una clave y escoge un modelo. Tu clave se guarda de forma segura en el Llavero de tu teléfono y nunca sale de él salvo como la petición que tú haces."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the only feature that leaves your phone — it sends a summary of your metrics to %@ using your own key. Nothing is sent until you ask.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the only feature that leaves your phone — it sends a summary of your metrics to %@ using your own key. Nothing is sent until you ask."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta es la única función que sale de tu teléfono — manda un resumen de tus métricas a %@ usando tu propia clave. No se envía nada hasta que preguntas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
