    "Importing overwrites everything currently in Cénit. Your old data is kept in a side file just in case, and Cénit needs a relaunch for an import to take effect. Export CSV writes a WHOOP-format zip of your days, sleeps, workouts and journal that re-imports into Cénit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importing overwrites everything currently in Cénit. Your old data is kept in a side file just in case, and Cénit needs a relaunch for an import to take effect. Export CSV writes a WHOOP-format zip of your days, sleeps, workouts and journal that re-imports into Cénit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Importar sobrescribe todo lo que hay en Cénit. Tus datos viejos se guardan en un archivo aparte por si acaso, y Cénit necesita reiniciarse para que el import surta efecto. Exportar CSV genera un zip en formato WHOOP de tus días, sueños, entrenamientos y diario que se re-importa a Cénit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On a 5/MG connection Cénit sends a probe after the handshake and logs what comes back. No effect on WHOOP 4.0.": {
