    "Free text is written by the Apple Intelligence model, which runs inside your iPhone. Your device doesn't support it, so I answer with pre-built questions and your engine's numbers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free text is written by the Apple Intelligence model, which runs inside your iPhone. Your device doesn't support it, so I answer with pre-built questions and your engine's numbers."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El texto libre lo redacta el modelo de Apple Intelligence, que corre dentro de tu iPhone. Tu equipo no lo soporta, así que respondo con preguntas prearmadas y las cifras de tu motor."
          }
