    "Cénit reads your recovery, sleep and strain and keeps them only on your iPhone. No account, no servers. Give it a few days of data and you'll start to see your patterns.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit reads your recovery, sleep and strain and keeps them only on your iPhone. No account, no servers. Give it a few days of data and you'll start to see your patterns."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit lee tu recuperación, sueño y esfuerzo y los guarda solo en tu iPhone. Sin cuenta, sin servidores. Dale unos días de datos y empezarás a ver tus patrones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cénit reads your sleep, steps, workouts, weight and heart rate from Apple Health to give you an honest read of your body.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit reads your sleep, steps, workouts, weight and heart rate from Apple Health to give you an honest read of your body."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cénit lee tu sueño, pasos, entrenamientos, peso y frecuencia cardiaca desde Apple Health para darte una lectura honesta de tu cuerpo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You left Apple Health access turned off. You can turn it on anytime in Settings. Cénit works without it, with less detail.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You left Apple Health access turned off. You can turn it on anytime in Settings. Cénit works without it, with less detail."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dejaste el acceso a Apple Health desactivado. Puedes activarlo cuando quieras desde Ajustes. Cénit funciona sin él, con menos detalle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In a moment your iPhone will ask for Bluetooth permission. Choose Allow so Cénit can find your strap. The connection is direct: nothing goes through the cloud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In a moment your iPhone will ask for Bluetooth permission. Choose Allow so Cénit can find your strap. The connection is direct: nothing goes through the cloud."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En un momento tu iPhone pedirá permiso de Bluetooth. Elige Permitir para que Cénit encuentre tu banda. La conexión es directa: nada pasa por la nube."
          }
        }
      }
