    "Across your recent days, this is a moment that tends to run higher or lower in stress. It's a tendency we observe, not a cause — and it needs several days before it shows. Computed on your iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Across your recent days, this is a moment that tends to run higher or lower in stress. It's a tendency we observe, not a cause — and it needs several days before it shows. Computed on your iPhone."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En tus días recientes, este es un momento que tiende a estar más alto o más bajo en estrés. Es una tendencia que observamos, no una causa — y necesita varios días para aparecer. Se calcula en tu iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
